            "review_title": "Review at Pho 45A - Tran Quoc Toan",
            "review_text": "LamN\nSingapore, Singapore4905 contributions\n0\n45A should strive more to be on the phở A list\nApr 2019 • Couples\nA bit confusing, as this place is located at 22, not 45A Trần Quốc Toản, and there never has been a phở restaurant at 45A. The phở here is not bad, but really nothing to scream about - there are tons of places like this in the city, so no need to drive to 45. Once there, you might as well pay VND55K for the large bowl, instead of just 45K.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 13, 2019",
